<li>NIOSH. Work Practices Guide for Manual Lifting, 1981. Waters TR et al. Revised NIOSH equation for the design and evaluation of manual lifting tasks. Ergonomics 1993. Gallagher S, Marras WS. Clin Biomech 2012. J\xE4ger M. EXCLI J 2018.</li>
